### Step 1 – Analyze (Explain increase/decrease)

- Created a line/column chart with Date on X-axis and [Total Sales] (or [Total Sales YTD]) on Y-axis.
- Used right-click on a data point → Analyze → Explain the increase/decrease.
- Reviewed the generated explanation (key drivers/segments) and added it to the report (if available).

What I learned:
- Explain increase/decrease is available only for certain visuals/fields.
- It helps identify which dimensions (e.g., Region/Category/Customer) likely drove the change.

